  "question_stem": "{{figure:diagram_q11_01}}\nIn the diagram, $OABCD$ is a solid figure in which $OA = OB = 4$ units and $OD = 3$ units. The edge $OD$ is vertical, $DC$ is parallel to $OB$ and $DC = 1$ unit. The base, $OAB$, is horizontal and angle $AOB = 90^{\\circ}$. Unit vectors $\\mathbf{i}$, $\\mathbf{j}$ and $\\mathbf{k}$ are parallel to $OA$, $OB$ and $OD$ respectively. The midpoint of $AB$ is $M$ and the point $N$ on $BC$ is such that $CN = 2NB$.",
